      "start_seconds": 0.69,
      "end_seconds": 7.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "yeah, doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.72,
      "end_seconds": 11.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "no problem at all come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.7,
      "end_seconds": 16.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "It's sudden breathlessness five days after surgery, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.28,
      "end_seconds": 22.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.26,
      "end_seconds": 28.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "I'm on metoprolol, 50 milligrams, maybe, twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.78,
      "end_seconds": 34.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.04,
      "end_seconds": 39.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "uh, no, it's at home"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.84,
      "end_seconds": 57.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.67,
      "end_seconds": 63.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Probably four weeks. Yeah. Oh, and a swollen calf."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.19,
      "end_seconds": 66.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Any sign of wound problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.75,
      "end_seconds": 71.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "well no none no wound problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.84,
      "end_seconds": 76.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Did you get coughing up blood or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.08,
      "end_seconds": 81.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "So, no, no coughing up blood or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.27,
      "end_seconds": 88.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.29,
      "end_seconds": 92.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "no nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.08,
      "end_seconds": 98.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.48,
      "end_seconds": 103.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "I'm allergic to cat fur, I get wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.62,
      "end_seconds": 107.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.91,
      "end_seconds": 111.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "An irregular heartbeat, for five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.22,
      "end_seconds": 114.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.68,
      "end_seconds": 118.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.5,
      "end_seconds": 120.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "I follow"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.28,
      "end_seconds": 134.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.79,
      "end_seconds": 137.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "no surgery no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.33,
      "end_seconds": 142.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.82,
      "end_seconds": 154.29,
      "duration_seconds": 11.47,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital. I hardly move around during the day. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.89,
      "end_seconds": 169.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.53,
      "end_seconds": 180.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.36,
      "end_seconds": 203.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "okay: pulse is 97 beats a minute, temperature 36.8, blood pressure 126 over 86."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.62,
      "end_seconds": 209.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.13,
      "end_seconds": 212.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Okay doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.42,
      "end_seconds": 215.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.63,
      "end_seconds": 230.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Your left calf is swollen and tender and your oxygen is low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.8,
      "end_seconds": 255.55,
      "duration_seconds": 20.75,
      "text": "that's all I needed to check. Okay so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with a possible blood clot in the lung after surgery at this stage. I'd also keep a chest infection in mind. We should do a CT pulmonary angiogram for possible pulmonary embolus"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 256.24,
      "end_seconds": 258.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "the earliest is Wednesday, 9 am"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.26,
      "end_seconds": 273.39,
      "duration_seconds": 13.13,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a D-dimer for possible clot. You'll be taking enoxaparin, 1.5 mg per kg, once now, single dose. That should help with possible clot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.11,
      "end_seconds": 276.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Fine, I'll begin it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.21,
      "end_seconds": 294.72,
      "duration_seconds": 17.51,
      "text": "Please go to hospital now, I will call ahead. We'll refer you to the emergency team. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.91,
      "end_seconds": 300.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "yes, I'll bear that that in mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.99,
      "end_seconds": 311.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "Let's plan a check straight away. Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.2,
      "end_seconds": 324.62,
      "duration_seconds": 11.42,
      "text": "So I take the enoxaparin 1.5 mg per kg once now and and come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.96,
      "end_seconds": 330.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "alright, yes, exactly right have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.7,
      "end_seconds": 334.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "thank you that's helpful"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.83,
      "end_seconds": 337.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "goodbye for now"
    }
